# Per-host aggregated dotenv schema for app-vm (Phase 11 / KOM-02 / D-14).
#
# FORWARD-COMPATIBLE PLACEHOLDER: app-vm currently runs ONLY the AIL Framework
# as a native systemd service (app-vm.service via SCREEN sessions under bastion),
# NOT docker-compose. This `.env.example` is a placeholder schema in case AIL
# is ever containerized OR a new docker workload lands on app-vm — append the
# new stack's variables here when that happens.
#
# If/when populated, copy to /opt/komodo/.env on app-vm and fill in real values.
# Komodo Periphery on app-vm would then invoke:
#   docker compose --env-file=/opt/komodo/.env up -d
#
# This file is gitignored via .gitignore *.env pattern from Phase 1 D-05.

# --- Site domain (mirrors root .env.example BASE_DOMAIN) ---
BASE_DOMAIN=__BASE-DOMAIN__
